"In 1972, Chile's government was linking the factories it ran to Santiago, in a project called Cybersyn.":"En 1972, el gobierno de Chile conectaba con Santiago las fábricas que dirigía, en un proyecto llamado Cybersyn.",
"Every afternoon, their numbers came in by telex.":"Cada tarde, sus cifras llegaban por télex.",
"But a number alone didn't say whether anything was wrong.":"Pero una cifra sola no decía si algo andaba mal.",
