"And with every factory reporting every day, one in trouble would be lost among the ones that were fine.":"Y con cada fábrica informando cada día, una en problemas se perdería entre las que estaban bien.",
"The people in charge needed to see the factories that needed them, and only those.":"Los responsables necesitaban ver las fábricas que los necesitaban, y solo esas.",
"So the project's software, Cyberstride, worked out from each factory's own history what was normal for it.":"Así que el software del proyecto, Cyberstride, calculaba con la historia de cada fábrica qué era normal para ella.",
"It compared each day's numbers with that, and passed on only what had changed.":"Comparaba con eso las cifras de cada día, y solo pasaba lo que había cambiado.",
"A warning was to go first to the factory's own manager, with time to put it right.":"Un aviso debía ir primero al gerente de la propia fábrica, con tiempo para corregirlo.",
"Only if it stayed wrong would it go on to Santiago.":"Solo si seguía mal pasaría a Santiago.",
"On 21 March 1972, the software printed its first results.":"El 21 de marzo de 1972, el software imprimió sus primeros resultados.",
"Stafford Beer, who designed Cybersyn, telexed that it really worked.":"Stafford Beer, quien diseñó Cybersyn, avisó por télex que de verdad funcionaba.",
"Instead of a wall of figures, the people in charge would see a few warnings, each beside its factory's normal.":"En vez de un muro de cifras, los responsables verían unos pocos avisos, cada uno junto a lo normal de su fábrica.",
"At the utility, Grace reads one measure every month: interruptions per customer, per year.":"En la empresa, Grace lee una medida cada mes: interrupciones por cliente, por año.",
